{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415659","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415659","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041565901:1":{"text":"나사레스의 폭정이 끝났으니 이제부터는 더 부드러운 통치가 필요합니다.","source_cn":"奈萨雷斯的残暴统治结束了，接下来的管理应当更温和一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F106590F758ACFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041565902:1":{"text":"과거의 비극이 반복되지 않도록 하려면...","source_cn":"为了避免昔日的惨剧重演……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF000344261624A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041565903:1":{"text":"친구여, 길을 잘못 든 것 같군.","source_cn":"朋友，我想你走上了歧途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FC67C48ACDB78FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041565904:1":{"text":"무엇으로 징벌의 고통을 덮을 수 있다고 생각하나?","source_cn":"你认为，用什么才能覆盖惩戒的痛楚呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DEBD0677D72EA24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041565905:1":{"text":"...위로? 보살핌? 다정함?","source_cn":"……安慰？照料？体贴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52E96F042CE1C66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041565906:1":{"text":"아니, 친구여. 정반대다.","source_cn":"不，亲爱的朋友，恰好相反。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x951CF29B62D29474","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041565907:1":{"text":"고통을 덮는 방법은 더 강한 고통을 덧씌우는 것뿐이지.","source_cn":"想要覆盖痛楚，唯有给予更强的痛楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F7237874A2A873","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041565908:1":{"text":"네 말대로 과거의 비극이 길을 잘못 든 것이라면, 바른 길은 이보다도 더 잔혹해야하지 않을까.","source_cn":"倘若如你所说，此前的惨剧已经走上歧途，那么正道就必须更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x518D3A6206E62830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041565909:1":{"text":"하, 그게 무슨 논리입니까!","source_cn":"哈！什么逻辑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4216AA327223B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041565910:1":{"text":"순진한 친구여, 처벌, 규율... 이 모든 것은 직관을 거스르는 법이지. 혹은 평민들의 직관에 불과하다고 할 수 있지.","source_cn":"惩罚、戒律，这一切原本就是反直觉——或者说是平民的直觉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B5608624B5F1A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041565911:1":{"text":"잊지 마. 네가 주는 모든 것은 “상”이야. 그게 당근이든, 채찍이든.","source_cn":"记住，你所给予的一切，都是“奖赏”，无论鞭子还是糖果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32432980C9E4B275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041565912:1":{"text":"채찍이 혹독할 수록 당근이 맛있는 법이지.","source_cn":"鞭子越严厉，糖果才会越甜美。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74BA71BF3AC67B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041565913:1":{"text":"그래야만 사람들이 네 규율 아래에서 순한 양처럼 복종하게 될 거야.","source_cn":"唯有如此，民众们才能在你的纪律下，服从如乖顺的羔羊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC9B24F0A96A007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041565914:1":{"text":"흥미가 생긴다면, 사냥개를 몇 마리 키워보는 것도 좋겠군.","source_cn":"若是尚有兴趣，还可以驯养些乖巧的猎犬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6210FA8BE0E9CDF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041565915:1":{"text":"날 믿어. 과정은 좀 귀찮더라도 결과는 아주 만족스러울 테니.","source_cn":"相信我，过程或许有些麻烦，但结果一定会令你满意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD0A72FE46391E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041565916:1":{"text":"만약 그 개에게 물린다면 만족스럽지 않을 텐데요.","source_cn":"如果狗反咬一口，恐怕滋味不太美妙吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AACF8BB7571991F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041565917:1":{"text":"...아쉽군.","source_cn":"……真遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x362D48F33ACCB801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041565918:1":{"text":"우리가 같은 책임을 지는 입장이라고 생각해서, 더 많은 이야기를 나눌 수 있을 줄 알았는데.","source_cn":"我原本以为我们的职责相同，会很有共同语言呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB9445EB47E223C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041565919:1":{"text":"나는 그저 출신에 따른 편견은 없다고 말하고 싶었을 뿐이야. 물론, 내 주변에 비슷한 취향을 가진 고귀한 친구들이 몇 명 있지만.","source_cn":"我与我一些有着相同嗜好的高贵友人们不同，对出身并无特别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4C8E2C643659BBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041565920:1":{"text":"하지만 평민은 결국 평민일 뿐이라는 사실을 실감했다는 걸 인정할 수밖에 없군.","source_cn":"但，此时我也不得不承认。平民总归是有平民的软弱之处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24528F22369ACF28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041565921:1":{"text":"공교롭지만 저도 “귀족의 잔혹함”을 깨부수기 위해 여기까지 온 사람입니다.","source_cn":"不巧，我也正是为了粉碎所谓“贵族的残酷”，才一路走到此处的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EBF3BCC4EF766A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041565922:1":{"text":"저 역시 과거에 당신과 같은 악행을 저질렀습니다. 행운인지 불행인지 모르겠지만, 저는 당신이 말한 “사냥개”였죠.","source_cn":"就算我曾经做过与你相似的恶行，但幸运或者不幸的是，我始...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D051E1BA0FE0B18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041565923:1":{"text":"하지만 지금까지도 “주인님”의 목을 물어뜯은 걸 후회한 적은 없습니다.","source_cn":"所以，至今为止，我也从未后悔过，回头咬烂那些尊贵“主人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A9FC98048DD9A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"슬레이저","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":2}}